    "body": "Thank you for this report and the exact reproduction.\n\nTriage, as you proposed: **bug**, **P3** (a wrong hole size with no message; workaround: check the hole list by hand), **effort:high**, **area:2d**. The fix should follow #1556 for Bore: skip or name each hole that does not match the drill, so a pilot drill stays possible when the user accepts it.\n\nIf you take it on, please comment `claimed:` with your plan, as on #2480.\n",
